<title>LEBANON: Lebanon's Solidere says GDR issue oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Lebanon's Solidere says GDR issue oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidere  SOLA.BL, Lebanon's biggest company, said on Thursday it successfully carried out an issue of Global Depositary Receipts on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Subscription orders reached a total of $140 million from international investment funds and institutions,&quot; Solidere said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;A total sum of $77 million only of the total subscription orders was allocated to funds that follow a medium or long term investment policy,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>Market sources said before the issue that Solidere planned to issue GDRs worth $115-125 million.</p>
<p>- Beirut editorial (961 1) 864148 353078 861723</p>
